          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਸੁਝਾਉਣਾ (sujhāuṇā) is inherited from Sanskrit śudhyati, \"is purified\", also \"becomes clear (of doubts)\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi sujhāuṇā, \"to explain\", under it (CDIAL 12527). CDIAL does not give the sense \"to suggest\"."
            }
